========================================================================
HONEST ACCOUNTING: Exact, Bounded, Imported
========================================================================

  EXACT SUPPORT:
    - R_base = 31/9 from group theory plus admitted 3/5 normalization
    - flatness algebra: Omega_Lambda = 1 - Omega_m - Omega_r once flatness is assumed

  BOUNDED / CONDITIONAL:
    - Sommerfeld correction S_vis/S_dark ~ 1.6 (QCD + freeze-out)
    - R = R_base * S_vis/S_dark ~ 5.5 (bounded by alpha_GUT)
    - flatness mechanism: S^3 topology or inflation

  IMPORTED (from observation):
    - eta = 6.12e-10 (baryon-to-photon ratio)
      -> exact DM one-flavor transport gives eta/eta_obs = 0.1888
      -> PMNS reduced-surface support reaches eta/eta_obs = 1
      -> still not promoted to live theorem-grade closure on this chain

  STANDARD PHYSICS (no free parameters given eta):
    - BBN: eta -> Omega_b
    - Friedmann equation: Omega_Lambda = 1 - Omega_m

  PARAMETER / STATUS COUNT for Omega_Lambda cascade:
    Given Omega_b (observed): requires bounded R plus flatness
    Given eta (observed): adds standard BBN to bounded R plus flatness
    Full first-principles closure: still needs eta and Sommerfeld/alpha_GUT closure

  [INFO] The chain Omega_b(obs) -> R(bounded) -> Omega_Lambda is a conditional
         cascade: the exact new piece is R_base = 31/9, while the full Omega_Lambda row remains bounded

